			"label": "Claude harness (docs/harness)",
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "ffec964df9503e64",
			"type": "group",
			"x": -700,
			"y": 760,
			"width": 1500,
			"height": 420,
			"label": "Team",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "dc76e9f0c0006e8f",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -300,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 600,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "# AegisPay\nZero-trust agentic payables on PayPal.\nPay only **verified vendors**, only for **goods received**, only within a **signed mandate**.\n\nSubmit **2026-11-11** · judging Dec 1–15",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "d14809f05ad6075c",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1460,
			"y": -500,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "## DECIDE (LLMs, read-only)\nLangGraph: ingest → forensics → match → score_risk → investigate? → short_pay_decide → policy_gate → human_review (interrupt) → approve_for_payment\n\nA1–A7 · zero write tools (R2, R14)",
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "39ae89e0a135945a",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -900,
			"y": -500,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "## EXECUTE (no LLM)\nSettlementService.execute(execution_id)\nreserve spend (R8) → POST payout (PENDING) → webhook/poll SUCCESS → VendorGateway record payment → SETTLED",
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "0b4e4886eb000e60",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1460,
			"y": -150,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## PayPal sandbox\n**Treasury app** — Payouts, payout webhooks, list_transactions\n**Vendor app** — Invoicing, invoicing webhooks\nTwo distinct accounts (R12)"
		},
		{
			"id": "caa155adf81fddd2",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -900,
			"y": -150,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 300,
			"text": "## Non-negotiables (§4)\nR1 payee lock · R3 amount derivation · R4 integer cents · R5 idempotency · R6 async payouts · R8 atomic cap · R9 duplicates · R10 webhook verify · R11 HITL integrity",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "03fb72467c33c5c7",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -1460,
			"y": 140,
			"width": 500,
			"height": 440,
			"text": "## Scenarios (§15)\n**S1** happy path → AUTO_SETTLE $480\n**S2** damaged → SHORT_PAY $425 (+ notice $75)\n**S3** BEC + injection → FREEZE, dual approval, reject; kill-switch proof\n**S4** duplicate → blocked < 1 s\n**S5** (P2) stale payee → UNCLAIMED"
		},
		{
			"id": "1392751eb4834f15",
			"type": "file",
			"x": -900,
			"y": 200,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 380,
			"file": "PRD_SRS.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "f187cebb22cb0444",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 440,
			"y": -500,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "### P0 · Oct 21–22\nSetup + SPIKE-1…9\nexit: spike table filled"
		},
		{
			"id": "b78f576611ec06f9",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": -500,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "### P1 · Oct 23–27\nPayPal clients, settlement, webhooks · app shell\nexit: **headless S1**"
		},
		{
			"id": "c5fd961c9f737a95",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 440,
			"y": -240,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "### P2 · Oct 28–Nov 2\nforensics, match, risk, gate, graph · widgets\nexit: **headless S1–S4** + EVAL"
		},
		{
			"id": "e4fbe62d887b8cde",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": -240,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "### P3 · Nov 3–6\ninvestigator, auth, deploy Nov 4 · vendor portal\nexit: **hosted S1–S4**; rough cut Nov 5"
		},
		{
			"id": "1b9645e71bb4d1ce",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 440,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "### P4 · Nov 7–8\nchaos/contract tests, Playwright\nexit: feature freeze"
		},
		{
			"id": "4197f5d83381787b",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 220,
			"text": "### P5 · Nov 9–11\nREADME, TOOLS, EVAL, video\nexit: **submitted**",
			"color": "1"
		},
		{
			"id": "bed97175b06e68eb",
			"type": "file",
			"x": 440,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 540,
			"height": 280,
			"file": "PLAN.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "d56d985300d4b52e",
			"type": "file",
			"x": 1020,
			"y": 300,
			"width": 580,
			"height": 280,
			"file": "CHECKLIST.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "fc166eb81361ff31",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -660,
			"y": -1250,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## Routing (deterministic)\n.claude/routing.json → UserPromptSubmit hook prints `route → agent / review / skills / rules`\nPath rules auto-load: money-safety · backend · frontend · ai-agents"
		},
		{
			"id": "7e6ba5052e452888",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -180,
			"y": -1250,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## Hooks\nSessionStart: pull + brief\nUserPromptSubmit: route\nPost-test: pull --rebase, push, commit nudge\nFailed test: never push"
		},
		{
			"id": "2629fb6d2384da89",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 300,
			"y": -1250,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 240,
			"text": "## Ponytail personas\n**Ledger** — ponytail-backend\n**Pixel** — ponytail-frontend\n**Sentinel** — ponytail-ai\n+ caveman (terse chat) · ECC reviewers"
		},
		{
			"id": "eccc4fdd5c655985",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -660,
			"y": -980,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 230,
			"text": "## Memory\nECC team vault `.ecc/memory/team/`\nmemory-keeper: /standup · /handoff · spawns skills\nstate = CHECKLIST, log = SESSION_LOG"
		},
		{
			"id": "f798b48cd2de63b2",
			"type": "file",
			"x": -180,
			"y": -980,
			"width": 440,
			"height": 230,
			"file": "harness/HARNESS.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "7babc233de26ab19",
			"type": "file",
			"x": 300,
			"y": -980,
			"width": 460,
			"height": 230,
			"file": "SESSION_LOG.md"
		},
		{
			"id": "c7e5ce427f47992a",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -660,
			"y": 820,
			"width": 700,
			"height": 320,
			"text": "## Dev A — backend, PayPal, agents\n`claude --agent ponytail-backend` / `ponytail-ai`\nOwns backend/, adr/, EVAL, TOOLS, SANDBOX_SETUP\nNext: P0-06 sandbox accounts → spikes",
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "59a5bff631b04b73",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 80,
			"y": 820,
			"width": 680,
			"height": 320,
			"text": "## Dev B — frontend, AG Studio, video\n`claude --agent ponytail-frontend`\nOwns frontend/, CI, render.yaml, USER_RESEARCH\nNext: P0-02 LICENSE, P0-03 CI, P0-13 SPIKE-7",
			"color": "3"
		}
	],
